1
00:00:12,103 --> 00:00:13,203
Is it real...?

2
00:00:14,846 --> 00:00:16,370
It’s actually for real...?

3
00:00:32,873 --> 00:00:34,542
Why?

4
00:00:37,420 --> 00:00:39,286
Why are you doing this to us?

5
00:00:41,340 --> 00:00:44,436
I guess this means
the kiDnap GAME has begun.

6
00:01:34,616 --> 00:01:37,049
KIDNAP GAME

7
00:01:39,455 --> 00:01:42,750
6 CONTESTRANTS LEFT.
8 DAYS AND 5 HOURS UNTIL THE GAME ENDS.

8
00:01:44,183 --> 00:01:45,101
TOKYO

9
00:01:45,184 --> 00:01:49,790
Why did you choose us?
What are you trying to achieve?

10
00:01:51,607 --> 00:01:54,796
So inquisitive. Insatiable.

11
00:01:56,779 --> 00:01:58,406
You're slaves to desire.

12
00:02:00,605 --> 00:02:03,733
That's one less rival... lucky you.

13
00:02:06,789 --> 00:02:08,416
You don't respect life.

14
00:02:08,499 --> 00:02:10,584
I can say the same to you.

15
00:02:10,835 --> 00:02:14,964
Are some lives worth more than others?

16
00:02:22,721 --> 00:02:25,433
- Police!
- Here we go.

17
00:02:25,558 --> 00:02:29,139
You're gonna use state power
and break the rules?

18
00:02:29,186 --> 00:02:33,274
I'm arresting you to rescue the hostages.
That's all.

19
00:02:33,337 --> 00:02:35,965
Do you understand?

20
00:02:36,318 --> 00:02:39,155
If you break the rules, your wife dies.

21
00:02:42,408 --> 00:02:43,951
You bastard...

22
00:02:44,034 --> 00:02:45,619
Excuse me, sir.

23
00:02:45,703 --> 00:02:46,941
- Stay back!
- Please stop.

24
00:02:49,957 --> 00:02:51,021
Don't move!

25
00:02:53,461 --> 00:02:56,584
Is this guy's life worth a lot?

26
00:02:57,134 --> 00:02:59,110
Or is it worth a little?

27
00:02:59,135 --> 00:03:00,690
Stop... Help me...

28
00:03:04,680 --> 00:03:06,348
- Move it!
- You okay?

29
00:03:17,526 --> 00:03:18,027
SEOUL
PM 01:04 KST

30
00:03:18,068 --> 00:03:20,613
I told you to cut it out.

31
00:03:21,197 --> 00:03:24,617
I said stop contacting me.

32
00:03:27,661 --> 00:03:28,746
MISSION

33
00:03:28,871 --> 00:03:30,623
COMMIT MURDER.

34
00:03:34,697 --> 00:03:38,909
Let go! Do I need to hit you again?

35
00:03:39,034 --> 00:03:40,452
COMMIT MURDER.

36
00:03:46,500 --> 00:03:47,918
COMMIT MURDER.

37
00:03:52,923 --> 00:03:54,466
COMMIT MURDER.

38
00:04:02,221 --> 00:04:02,675
SINGAPORE
PM 12:04 SGT

39
00:04:02,700 --> 00:04:04,869
Handed by responding police officer.

40
00:04:05,075 --> 00:04:07,744
Police believe that
the would-be bank robbers were motivated...

41
00:04:07,837 --> 00:04:10,173
What do you mean? This is not a prank!

42
00:04:10,315 --> 00:04:12,443
Tony will die if I don’t
complete this mission.

43
00:04:12,568 --> 00:04:14,270
Robbers were motivated by...

44
00:04:16,071 --> 00:04:20,242
- Asian Civilisations Museum! Hurry, please!
- OK.

45
00:04:20,367 --> 00:04:23,912
Where they have the
treasure-laden ship that sank! Yes!

46
00:04:29,337 --> 00:04:29,796
TAIPEI
PM 12:07 TST

47
00:04:29,830 --> 00:04:33,793
Hey, you haven't told anyone
about us, have you?

48
00:04:34,460 --> 00:04:37,088
You deleted the video, right?

49
00:04:39,131 --> 00:04:42,093
That's okay, then...

50
00:04:44,178 --> 00:04:45,178
ATRA
FLOWER SHOP

51
00:04:52,979 --> 00:04:54,855
NAHA

52
00:04:54,939 --> 00:04:56,983
PM 01:07 JST

53
00:05:01,404 --> 00:05:04,084
Let go! Put me down!

54
00:05:06,826 --> 00:05:09,437
What do I need to beat this psycho?

55
00:05:09,954 --> 00:05:12,710
DON'T WORRY. YOU'RE GONNA WIN FOR SURE.

56
00:05:18,170 --> 00:05:19,630
Dammit...

57
00:05:19,922 --> 00:05:21,250
BANGKOK

58
00:05:21,275 --> 00:05:22,776
AM 11:08 ICT

59
00:05:27,388 --> 00:05:28,597
MISSION

60
00:05:28,598 --> 00:05:32,518
MAKE BENZ WANG ADMIT AND
PUBLICLY CONFESS HIS DRUG SYNDICATE TIES.

61
00:05:35,438 --> 00:05:37,315
BENZ WANG

62
00:05:37,398 --> 00:05:40,735
POLITICIAN BEHIND
CANNABIS LEGALIZATION

63
00:05:41,319 --> 00:05:43,571
No way he'd admit to that.

64
00:05:48,743 --> 00:05:50,077
Dao...

65
00:06:01,922 --> 00:06:03,341
Aum...

66
00:06:07,136 --> 00:06:08,930
Help me...

67
00:06:12,184 --> 00:06:12,810
PM 02:19 JST
SHINJUKU CENTRAL POLICE STATION
SPECIAL INVESTIGATION HEADQUARTERS

68
00:06:12,850 --> 00:06:17,980
We will not conduct a sloppy
investigation like the Manila Police.

69
00:06:18,105 --> 00:06:23,110
As it is, we've got zero suspects
and nothing on the vehicle.

70
00:06:23,569 --> 00:06:29,617
On top of that, the hostage's husband,
Toshiro Niide, gave us the slip.

71
00:06:29,700 --> 00:06:35,283
Chief Inspector Takatsuki,
what should we make of that?

72
00:06:41,003 --> 00:06:44,507
Niide wants to arrest
the kidnappers by him...

73
00:06:44,590 --> 00:06:47,134
A lower-level cop can't handle this!

74
00:06:48,386 --> 00:06:49,387
Yes.

75
00:06:51,430 --> 00:06:53,849
Find Niide immediately!

76
00:06:54,141 --> 00:06:55,434
Yes sir!

77
00:07:00,106 --> 00:07:04,068
"kiDnap GAME."
You really haven't heard of it?

78
00:07:04,945 --> 00:07:09,532
The man arrested in Manila was shouting,
"this is a game."

79
00:07:12,618 --> 00:07:15,246
Sorry, I couldn't tell you.

80
00:07:15,997 --> 00:07:18,541
I'm being forced to play the game.

81
00:07:18,874 --> 00:07:20,167
What?!

82
00:07:21,127 --> 00:07:23,129
This is my crash pad.

83
00:07:23,421 --> 00:07:25,881
Don't expect a five-star stay.

84
00:07:26,298 --> 00:07:27,508
Thanks.

85
00:07:28,467 --> 00:07:30,261
How dare you lie!

86
00:07:30,678 --> 00:07:35,015
One hostage was killed!
Saori could be next.

87
00:07:36,725 --> 00:07:38,269
I'm sorry.

88
00:07:40,646 --> 00:07:43,107
The only reason I have this job...

89
00:07:44,567 --> 00:07:46,360
is because of Saori.

90
00:07:49,243 --> 00:07:53,456
Six years ago,
I felt the whole world was against me.

91
00:07:54,970 --> 00:07:55,470
6 YEARS AGO

92
00:07:55,495 --> 00:07:57,289
Explain yourself.

93
00:07:57,446 --> 00:07:59,756
I told you to verify everything.

94
00:08:00,044 --> 00:08:02,755
How dare you make a mistake of fact!

95
00:08:02,918 --> 00:08:07,506
We're getting crucified by other networks,
both on and offline!

96
00:08:07,590 --> 00:08:09,759
This is on your head.

97
00:08:16,849 --> 00:08:19,268
If Saori hadn't been there...

98
00:08:20,227 --> 00:08:22,188
Here you go.

99
00:08:26,984 --> 00:08:29,695
If you don't eat and feel better,

100
00:08:30,237 --> 00:08:33,783
you won't be able to
start over or make amends.

101
00:08:56,889 --> 00:09:01,143
Saori would always try to save people.

102
00:09:02,436 --> 00:09:05,022
I want to save her as much as you do.

103
00:09:05,606 --> 00:09:08,359
No more lies and secrets from now on.

104
00:09:10,277 --> 00:09:11,277
Okay.

105
00:09:12,279 --> 00:09:16,492
It's hard to imagine
the hostages were chosen at random.

106
00:09:16,617 --> 00:09:20,412
There must be a common denominator...

107
00:09:20,538 --> 00:09:22,581
A reason why they were chosen.

108
00:09:23,207 --> 00:09:28,712
You mean the perp took their loved ones
out of a grudge against the players?

109
00:09:28,963 --> 00:09:30,131
Exactly.

110
00:09:30,798 --> 00:09:32,716
I want to find the others.

111
00:09:34,593 --> 00:09:37,680
The Naha hostage is Tomiko Higa.

112
00:09:38,180 --> 00:09:43,686
Her son Kuranosuke is a software engineer,
fairly famous in IT circles.

113
00:09:44,103 --> 00:09:48,607
He developed the Uchiake app
that was popular a while back.

114
00:09:48,899 --> 00:09:50,317
Any other family?

115
00:09:50,693 --> 00:09:52,027
Doesn't look like it.

116
00:09:52,778 --> 00:09:57,199
Then there's no doubt he's the player.

117
00:09:57,658 --> 00:10:01,328
This man kidnapped in Taipei
is a chef patron.

118
00:10:01,579 --> 00:10:05,624
He lives with his wife,
teenage daughter, and young son.

119
00:10:05,875 --> 00:10:08,502
The children probably aren't involved.

120
00:10:08,586 --> 00:10:11,755
That leaves the wife.

121
00:10:11,839 --> 00:10:14,508
She's a model known for looking young.

122
00:10:15,050 --> 00:10:17,553
The heir kidnapped in Singapore...

123
00:10:19,138 --> 00:10:22,558
I think his girlfriend is a player.

124
00:10:22,808 --> 00:10:26,270
She made the viral kiDnap GAME post.

125
00:10:26,395 --> 00:10:28,022
Any posts after that?

126
00:10:28,105 --> 00:10:29,106
None.

127
00:10:29,732 --> 00:10:31,358
Right.

128
00:10:36,906 --> 00:10:39,950
An illness left her blind five years ago.

129
00:10:40,743 --> 00:10:46,290
Her father is a renowned surgeon,
but he rarely operates now.

130
00:10:46,624 --> 00:10:50,419
Have any of you seen my daughter?

131
00:10:50,544 --> 00:10:53,297
The father's the player, then?

132
00:10:54,590 --> 00:11:00,012
But the mother is also famous
and owns a popular beauty brand.

133
00:11:02,681 --> 00:11:05,184
So it's one of the parents...

134
00:11:07,686 --> 00:11:10,314
But what about the woman in Bangkok?

135
00:11:10,564 --> 00:11:15,194
Her wealthy parents are deceased
with no living relatives.

136
00:11:15,486 --> 00:11:17,696
Maybe the player is her lover.

137
00:11:18,489 --> 00:11:22,034
Could be.
I'll look up the men around her.

138
00:11:22,159 --> 00:11:23,452
Thanks.

139
00:11:24,328 --> 00:11:28,499
So far, nothing seems to connect everyone.

140
00:11:28,624 --> 00:11:29,917
Yeah...

141
00:11:30,542 --> 00:11:31,794
What's the plan?

142
00:11:32,086 --> 00:11:35,506
I'll have to ask the
other players directly.

143
00:11:36,131 --> 00:11:40,261
Will they cooperate?
"Only one shall prevail," right?

144
00:11:40,344 --> 00:11:42,846
They'll be racing to finish first.

145
00:11:43,263 --> 00:11:44,473
Yeah.

146
00:11:44,682 --> 00:11:46,976
It's all I can do at the moment.

147
00:11:49,103 --> 00:11:50,229
I need to get back.

148
00:11:54,066 --> 00:11:55,859
I'll call if I learn more.

149
00:11:55,943 --> 00:11:56,944
Okay.

150
00:12:12,751 --> 00:12:15,546
I'm in the kiDnap GAME. Can we talk?

151
00:12:22,761 --> 00:12:23,929
What do you want?

152
00:12:24,013 --> 00:12:27,016
If you’re in the game then you shouldn’t be
wasting time writing to me.

153
00:12:28,392 --> 00:12:30,185
I want to identify the kidnapper.

154
00:12:30,602 --> 00:12:33,856
There must be a common denominator
among us players somewhere.

155
00:12:35,774 --> 00:12:38,027
Common denominator...?

156
00:12:41,363 --> 00:12:44,950
I don’t know. I’m in a hurry to
complete some kind of mission.

157
00:12:45,075 --> 00:12:46,216
He’ll die if I’m late.

158
00:12:47,882 --> 00:12:48,982
We’ve arrived.

159
00:12:55,753 --> 00:12:58,881
I don’t have anything to say to you.
Don’t text me!

160
00:13:29,995 --> 00:13:33,499
CHECKPOINT ONE CLEARED.
AWAIT NEXT INSTRUCTION.

161
00:13:50,766 --> 00:13:53,477
I’M IN THE KIDNAP GAME. CAN WE TALK?

162
00:13:53,852 --> 00:13:54,852
What's this?

163
00:13:56,396 --> 00:13:57,396
What?

164
00:13:57,981 --> 00:13:59,010
"kiDnap GAME?"

165
00:14:08,117 --> 00:14:09,176
Come.

166
00:14:14,123 --> 00:14:15,415
Show me.

167
00:14:18,949 --> 00:14:20,951
TOSHIRO NIIDE

168
00:14:21,213 --> 00:14:23,215
kiDnap... as in "kidnap"?

169
00:14:25,676 --> 00:14:27,261
Are you in it too?!

170
00:14:27,344 --> 00:14:29,138
You can't be serious.

171
00:14:29,221 --> 00:14:32,057
Was Rian kidnapped for a game?!

172
00:14:32,141 --> 00:14:33,934
Calm down. It's a prank!

173
00:14:34,017 --> 00:14:35,037
We've got to reply...

174
00:14:35,844 --> 00:14:38,603
What do I say?
I'll do anything to save her!

175
00:14:39,106 --> 00:14:42,943
Look, please just calm down...

176
00:14:46,697 --> 00:14:50,075
I'll save Rian...

177
00:14:50,159 --> 00:14:54,037
I'll definitely save her.

178
00:15:00,669 --> 00:15:02,963
I'm in the kiDnap GAME.
Let's talk.

179
00:15:12,389 --> 00:15:13,807
What's your mission?

180
00:15:18,270 --> 00:15:20,189
To capture the mastermind.

181
00:15:24,693 --> 00:15:27,571
I gain nothing by cooperating.
I will win.

182
00:15:34,411 --> 00:15:36,205
I just want to talk.

183
00:15:52,971 --> 00:15:54,306
AKINA ISOBE

184
00:15:57,643 --> 00:15:58,810
Any leads?

185
00:15:59,068 --> 00:16:02,488
The woman in Bangkok
hangs out with a few men,

186
00:16:02,606 --> 00:16:04,430
but no one seems to be special.

187
00:16:04,853 --> 00:16:06,396
I see...

188
00:16:06,777 --> 00:16:08,904
But she has a female roommate.

189
00:16:08,987 --> 00:16:10,239
A roommate...

190
00:16:10,322 --> 00:16:14,034
Apparently she's a
hostess renting the room.

191
00:16:15,035 --> 00:16:16,488
Thanks for the tip.

192
00:16:17,329 --> 00:16:19,164
Any details on the roommate?

193
00:16:19,248 --> 00:16:20,788
I'll send a link.

194
00:16:21,785 --> 00:16:24,336
PM 07:14 JST

195
00:16:50,946 --> 00:16:52,670
Matching misanga bracelets...

196
00:17:02,374 --> 00:17:05,252
I’M IN THE KIDNAP GAME. CAN WE TALK?

197
00:17:08,714 --> 00:17:10,340
Come on...

198
00:17:13,635 --> 00:17:16,179
OK

199
00:17:22,060 --> 00:17:24,771
Coming late and bringing a partner...

200
00:17:24,896 --> 00:17:26,773
- Never mind.
- Right?

201
00:17:26,898 --> 00:17:28,650
- Let it go.
- Right?

202
00:17:29,568 --> 00:17:33,030
BENZ WANG'S DAUGHTER
IN STUDENT PROTESTS

203
00:17:33,155 --> 00:17:36,325
I was wondering why they came here.

204
00:17:36,658 --> 00:17:39,870
Well, Hansa said her dad's super rich.

205
00:17:40,454 --> 00:17:44,416
Hi. I’m the player from
Tokyo... English okay?

206
00:17:45,083 --> 00:17:46,877
Yes, English is okay.

207
00:17:47,294 --> 00:17:49,212
I’m Aum. Bangkok.

208
00:17:49,963 --> 00:17:53,884
You’re participating for
Dao Saetang, is that right?

209
00:17:54,134 --> 00:17:56,496
- Yup.
- Thanks.

210
00:17:57,054 --> 00:17:59,222
My wife was kidnapped.

211
00:17:59,973 --> 00:18:06,480
Tokyo... so you’re police, right?
What’s your mission?

212
00:18:07,022 --> 00:18:08,649
To capture the mastermind.

213
00:18:09,149 --> 00:18:14,988
You’re trying to catch the mastermind
to finish the game to save your wife, huh?

214
00:18:15,781 --> 00:18:16,990
No!

215
00:18:17,199 --> 00:18:22,371
The second you catch the mastermind,
you win the game.

216
00:18:22,496 --> 00:18:24,706
Then all the other hostages will die.

217
00:18:25,165 --> 00:18:28,377
- Sorry, I can’t work with you.
- Why?

218
00:18:29,044 --> 00:18:31,046
You helped me make up my mind.

219
00:18:33,298 --> 00:18:35,983
I’m gonna try and complete my own mission.

220
00:18:37,784 --> 00:18:38,784
Wait!

221
00:19:31,356 --> 00:19:34,860
PLEASE DON’T CONTACT MY WIFE.

222
00:19:34,932 --> 00:19:36,183
Wife...

223
00:19:39,573 --> 00:19:41,283
So it's the doctor...

224
00:19:48,999 --> 00:19:52,252
ARE YOU THE ONE IN THE GAME?

225
00:20:00,886 --> 00:20:04,431
I WANT TO WORK TOGETHER. PLEASE TALK TO ME.

226
00:20:29,039 --> 00:20:30,624
I believe you.

227
00:20:33,251 --> 00:20:35,003
I believe in you.

228
00:20:38,965 --> 00:20:39,965
DAY 3

229
00:20:39,966 --> 00:20:42,469
XX UNIVERSITY, BANGKOK
AM 11:02 ICT

230
00:20:53,104 --> 00:20:55,850
Whoa, you've made a lot already.

231
00:20:56,441 --> 00:20:57,816
At the cost of my sleep.

232
00:21:02,489 --> 00:21:07,744
Don't overdo it. You don't look well.

233
00:21:08,829 --> 00:21:10,956
You head home. I'll do the rest.

234
00:21:11,748 --> 00:21:14,751
Okay. I'll go home.

235
00:21:21,091 --> 00:21:22,634
Hansa Wang?

236
00:21:26,972 --> 00:21:27,972
Get in there.

237
00:21:32,727 --> 00:21:33,979
What's going on?

238
00:21:34,479 --> 00:21:36,856
- Get lost!
- Hansa?!

239
00:21:51,746 --> 00:21:53,415
Call your father.

240
00:21:54,457 --> 00:21:55,333
My father?

241
00:21:55,458 --> 00:21:59,004
Benz Wang! Yes! Now!

242
00:22:01,590 --> 00:22:02,465
Sir?

243
00:22:02,549 --> 00:22:03,800
What is it?

244
00:22:04,342 --> 00:22:05,760
It's your daughter.

245
00:22:07,012 --> 00:22:08,263
Hansa?

246
00:22:09,723 --> 00:22:10,932
I'm done talking.

247
00:22:11,016 --> 00:22:12,976
Something doesn't seem right.

248
00:22:17,522 --> 00:22:18,690
What?

249
00:22:19,065 --> 00:22:23,445
Publicly confess to your crimes
or I'll kill your daughter.

250
00:22:24,404 --> 00:22:28,825
What's going on? Is this a joke?

251
00:22:29,618 --> 00:22:32,913
Save me! Please!

252
00:22:34,748 --> 00:22:36,124
You got that?

253
00:22:36,333 --> 00:22:41,004
Come clean publicly or your daughter dies.

254
00:22:45,675 --> 00:22:48,011
Wait, come clean about what?

255
00:22:48,094 --> 00:22:52,849
Your ties to the drug syndicate!
You're in collusion, right?!

256
00:22:53,266 --> 00:22:57,729
Get the press there and tell the country!

257
00:23:44,526 --> 00:23:46,194
Why are you doing this?

258
00:23:47,153 --> 00:23:48,863
Just behave yourself.

259
00:23:49,614 --> 00:23:51,825
My father disowned me.

260
00:23:53,702 --> 00:23:56,454
It doesn't matter. A parent's a parent.

261
00:23:56,538 --> 00:24:00,458
Don't make any funny
moves or I'll kill you.

262
00:24:15,098 --> 00:24:18,601
Assault team is in position.
Shall we move in?

263
00:24:19,227 --> 00:24:24,691
The building is completely surrounded.

264
00:24:25,066 --> 00:24:29,863
Release the hostage
and surrender immediately.

265
00:24:30,113 --> 00:24:34,492
A hostage crisis is unfolding
at this university in Bangkok.

266
00:24:35,452 --> 00:24:41,124
A young woman armed with a knife
has taken a student prisoner.

267
00:24:44,544 --> 00:24:46,004
Don't come any closer.

268
00:24:47,047 --> 00:24:49,549
If you do, I'll kill her.

269
00:24:51,509 --> 00:24:54,012
I only have one demand!

270
00:24:54,888 --> 00:24:56,264
Benz Wang!

271
00:24:57,098 --> 00:24:59,392
If you want to save your daughter,

272
00:24:59,601 --> 00:25:04,272
admit your ties to the drug syndicate
and make a public confession!

273
00:25:07,275 --> 00:25:09,319
The captor has made a demand.

274
00:25:09,402 --> 00:25:11,696
She wants M.P. Benz Wang

275
00:25:11,780 --> 00:25:16,409
to publicly confess
his alleged drug syndicate ties.

276
00:25:16,493 --> 00:25:21,372
The hostage has been identified as
Hansa Wang, daughter of...

277
00:25:21,456 --> 00:25:22,957
Dammit.

278
00:25:23,374 --> 00:25:25,019
According to local police,
the hostage, identified as Hansa Wang...

279
00:25:25,043 --> 00:25:28,213
STANDOFF IN BANGKOK.
CAPTOR IS LIKELY A KIDNAP GAME PLAYER.

280
00:25:34,636 --> 00:25:36,221
So what?!

281
00:25:46,564 --> 00:25:51,277
The captor demands that
Benz Wang publicly admit links...

282
00:25:52,403 --> 00:25:54,197
We have a new development.

283
00:25:54,280 --> 00:25:58,284
A student was taken hostage
at a Bangkok university...

284
00:25:58,368 --> 00:26:03,039
The hostage has been identified
as the daughter of Benz Wang...

285
00:26:04,791 --> 00:26:07,836
I hope you're not contacting the detective.

286
00:26:09,712 --> 00:26:12,132
Unless you're gathering info,

287
00:26:12,215 --> 00:26:16,594
you'll be committing another
grave offense as a journalist.

288
00:26:17,929 --> 00:26:19,472
We're not in contact.

289
00:26:19,931 --> 00:26:23,726
I'll have you know,
the police came asking about you.

290
00:26:32,694 --> 00:26:33,570
Yes?

291
00:26:33,653 --> 00:26:35,446
Get out of there.

292
00:26:35,530 --> 00:26:36,530
What?

293
00:26:36,573 --> 00:26:40,159
The police are on to me.
It's not safe there.

294
00:26:41,536 --> 00:26:42,704
Got it.

295
00:27:12,984 --> 00:27:14,116
He's here!

296
00:27:24,829 --> 00:27:26,456
Give up already!

297
00:27:31,294 --> 00:27:32,462
Run!

298
00:27:33,630 --> 00:27:35,256
Go!

299
00:27:36,049 --> 00:27:37,133
Niide!

300
00:27:44,265 --> 00:27:45,391
Hyodo...

301
00:27:54,817 --> 00:27:55,693
Hello?

302
00:27:55,777 --> 00:27:59,656
This is Uemura, from the food truck.

303
00:28:00,823 --> 00:28:01,823
What is it?

304
00:28:02,241 --> 00:28:06,955
Just now, a young man left me
a package to give to you.

305
00:28:08,164 --> 00:28:09,749
A young man?

306
00:28:10,333 --> 00:28:11,751
PM 01:35 ICT

307
00:28:11,793 --> 00:28:14,754
What are you waiting for?

308
00:28:15,588 --> 00:28:18,716
The hostage is a politician's daughter.

309
00:28:18,800 --> 00:28:23,471
If anything happens to her,
we'll be in serious trouble.

310
00:28:47,745 --> 00:28:50,373
If you die, it'll all be for nothing.

311
00:28:54,377 --> 00:28:55,712
Thanks.

312
00:29:11,144 --> 00:29:12,186
Where's yours?

313
00:29:12,854 --> 00:29:16,691
That's all I have.
I didn't think it'd take this long.

314
00:29:19,027 --> 00:29:21,446
LIVE FROM M.P. BENZ WANG'S HOME

315
00:29:22,030 --> 00:29:25,158
What you said about my father...

316
00:29:27,201 --> 00:29:28,619
Is it true?

317
00:29:36,085 --> 00:29:40,548
I heard that rumor once
and demanded answers from him.

318
00:29:44,802 --> 00:29:49,640
That's why he disowned me.

319
00:29:52,018 --> 00:29:53,352
I'm sorry...

320
00:29:55,730 --> 00:29:57,732
for dragging you into this.

321
00:29:58,357 --> 00:30:02,070
I'll confess to his crimes instead.
So don't do this.

322
00:30:02,570 --> 00:30:04,364
That's no use.

323
00:30:08,993 --> 00:30:11,913
You know about the
simultaneous kidnappings?

324
00:30:13,414 --> 00:30:14,624
Yes.

325
00:30:17,085 --> 00:30:19,378
My girlfriend was kidnapped.

326
00:30:22,673 --> 00:30:29,180
The kidnapper told me to make Benz Wang
publicly confess his drug syndicate ties.

327
00:30:31,474 --> 00:30:33,935
Said it was a kiDnap GAME.

328
00:30:35,645 --> 00:30:39,363
KiDnap GAME...
I thought it was only a rumor.

329
00:30:41,067 --> 00:30:42,180
No...

330
00:30:44,779 --> 00:30:48,463
I couldn't think of a better way.

331
00:30:50,952 --> 00:30:57,500
That person must be
so precious to you for you to do this.

332
00:30:58,876 --> 00:31:00,622
Dao's my first true love.

333
00:31:04,257 --> 00:31:06,384
I'd do anything for her.

334
00:31:10,221 --> 00:31:12,100
I owe my life to Dao.

335
00:31:13,599 --> 00:31:17,356
I used to be addicted to marijuana
and my life was a mess...

336
00:31:18,688 --> 00:31:21,376
She set me back on my feet.

337
00:31:39,083 --> 00:31:40,710
Where do you live?

338
00:31:43,337 --> 00:31:45,323
I don't have a home.

339
00:31:50,845 --> 00:31:51,845
What?

340
00:31:54,515 --> 00:32:00,855
Dao has a big apartment,
and she let me live there.

341
00:32:11,490 --> 00:32:14,535
But I didn't want to be a burden to her.

342
00:32:15,786 --> 00:32:17,465
I wanted to be her equal.

343
00:32:20,166 --> 00:32:27,340
So I started doing bad things again
to earn money.

344
00:32:28,174 --> 00:32:31,844
You're still smoking this stuff?!

345
00:32:32,470 --> 00:32:34,083
I thought you already quit!

346
00:32:35,056 --> 00:32:36,807
You promised me.

347
00:32:38,392 --> 00:32:39,977
I don't use it anymore.

348
00:32:40,061 --> 00:32:41,590
Then what's this?

349
00:32:45,316 --> 00:32:50,183
Are you still dealing?

350
00:32:51,239 --> 00:32:52,596
Why, Aum?!

351
00:32:54,220 --> 00:32:56,158
It's the only way I know how to live!

352
00:33:08,714 --> 00:33:10,883
Deep down, I knew Dao was right.

353
00:33:14,095 --> 00:33:17,139
I just didn't want to lose her.

354
00:33:18,057 --> 00:33:20,309
Dao waited for me to come home...

355
00:33:22,228 --> 00:33:24,564
and that's when they took her.

356
00:33:30,987 --> 00:33:32,154
Aum!

357
00:33:36,867 --> 00:33:38,619
A present from Aum.

358
00:33:39,870 --> 00:33:41,289
From Aum?

359
00:33:47,295 --> 00:33:48,337
Dao!

360
00:33:48,421 --> 00:33:52,508
When I went back to apologize,

361
00:33:52,967 --> 00:33:55,845
she was already gone...

362
00:33:58,055 --> 00:33:59,974
I never told her how I felt.

363
00:34:03,978 --> 00:34:06,439
That's why I'd do anything...

364
00:34:09,817 --> 00:34:11,694
to see Dao one more time.

365
00:34:16,282 --> 00:34:18,034
I'll help you.

366
00:34:22,580 --> 00:34:23,456
Sir?

367
00:34:23,539 --> 00:34:25,291
- What?
- Look at this.

368
00:34:27,585 --> 00:34:32,214
Dad, please admit and
confess what you did... Please!

369
00:34:33,841 --> 00:34:36,677
If you don't confess within an hour...

370
00:34:38,763 --> 00:34:44,477
Please help me, Dad! Please!

371
00:34:47,938 --> 00:34:49,357
This is a live video.

372
00:34:49,649 --> 00:34:52,360
How will Mr. Benz respond?

373
00:34:52,651 --> 00:34:57,281
His daughter's being held hostage,
and he still won't confess?

374
00:34:57,448 --> 00:34:59,116
Look at this.

375
00:34:59,200 --> 00:35:02,036
He still won't come clean.

376
00:35:02,119 --> 00:35:04,455
Oh my god. I hope she makes it.

377
00:35:06,874 --> 00:35:08,417
The package you mentioned...

378
00:35:11,420 --> 00:35:13,089
This is it.

379
00:35:13,881 --> 00:35:15,216
That's him!

380
00:35:18,928 --> 00:35:20,012
That bastard...

381
00:35:20,096 --> 00:35:21,722
He brought this.

382
00:35:28,187 --> 00:35:30,064
- Get rid of it!
- Huh?!

383
00:35:30,147 --> 00:35:31,190
Now!

384
00:35:44,495 --> 00:35:45,871
Dammit.

385
00:35:49,750 --> 00:35:51,502
Are you okay?

386
00:35:51,585 --> 00:35:52,920
I'm fine.

387
00:35:53,170 --> 00:35:55,131
What was that?

388
00:35:55,297 --> 00:35:58,676
Sorry, it's all my fault...

389
00:36:00,302 --> 00:36:01,496
He acted strange.

390
00:36:02,476 --> 00:36:05,141
He talked to me in Korean at first.

391
00:36:05,190 --> 00:36:06,608
Hello.

392
00:36:08,269 --> 00:36:11,063
Can you give this to detective Niide?

393
00:36:13,107 --> 00:36:16,819
Can you give this
to a detective called "Niide"?

394
00:36:17,570 --> 00:36:18,570
Korean?

395
00:36:18,946 --> 00:36:19,946
Yes.

396
00:36:23,951 --> 00:36:26,036
Sorry, I'll call you later.

397
00:36:32,626 --> 00:36:35,563
Please... Just confess!

398
00:36:45,055 --> 00:36:46,682
You okay?

399
00:36:47,183 --> 00:36:50,728
It's my asthma...
I have an inhaler in my bag...

400
00:36:58,652 --> 00:36:59,904
This bag?

401
00:37:00,613 --> 00:37:01,822
No.

402
00:37:06,744 --> 00:37:11,373
Confess your crime, Benz Wang,
or your daughter dies.

403
00:37:25,346 --> 00:37:26,606
Call a press conference.

404
00:37:32,603 --> 00:37:36,440
Mr. Wang is ready
to begin the press conference.

405
00:37:36,524 --> 00:37:37,775
Please come in.

406
00:37:38,275 --> 00:37:42,655
We've been called inside.
Benz Wang may be about to confess.

407
00:37:45,115 --> 00:37:49,578
They said he's going to make a confession.

408
00:37:52,498 --> 00:37:57,795
Then your loved one's going to be safe.

409
00:38:00,047 --> 00:38:02,049
Yeah. Thanks.

410
00:38:11,851 --> 00:38:14,019
BENZ TO HOLD PRESS CONFERENCE

411
00:38:14,103 --> 00:38:15,104
Really?

412
00:38:26,240 --> 00:38:28,909
What's the situation, sir?

413
00:38:29,034 --> 00:38:30,995
What can you tell us?

414
00:38:31,161 --> 00:38:34,790
Have you been in
contact with your daughter?

415
00:38:34,915 --> 00:38:39,336
What can you tell us? Answer, please!

416
00:38:39,461 --> 00:38:43,716
Is it true that your
daughter was kidnapped?

417
00:38:45,593 --> 00:38:50,848
I swear by the gods of heaven and earth,
and by my beloved daughter.

418
00:38:52,182 --> 00:38:55,978
What I am about to tell
the citizens of Thailand

419
00:38:58,272 --> 00:39:01,900
and the whole world is the truth.

420
00:39:07,364 --> 00:39:08,865
THE TIME LIMIT IS TEN DAYS.

421
00:39:08,866 --> 00:39:11,266
THE GAME WILL END IF A PLAYER COMPLETES
THE ASSIGNED MISSION.

422
00:39:13,913 --> 00:39:16,165
ONLY ONE SHALL PREVAIL...

423
00:39:19,793 --> 00:39:22,171
ONLY ONE SHALL SURVIVE...

424
00:39:24,506 --> 00:39:26,050
I, Benz Wang...

425
00:39:32,473 --> 00:39:36,136
have no ties to any drug syndicate
or similar organization!

426
00:39:37,394 --> 00:39:38,812
Goddamn it!

427
00:39:40,022 --> 00:39:41,022
Even if it means

428
00:39:42,191 --> 00:39:47,029
losing my beloved daughter,
I cannot lie to the people.

429
00:39:48,948 --> 00:39:52,756
Nor can I ever bend to cowardly blackmail.

430
00:39:53,828 --> 00:39:56,256
Hansa... My beloved daughter...

431
00:39:56,789 --> 00:40:02,753
Please forgive your fool of a father.

432
00:40:14,306 --> 00:40:16,684
Gimme a goddamn break!

433
00:40:20,980 --> 00:40:23,482
This is bad. SWAT team, standby.

434
00:40:23,565 --> 00:40:24,565
Yes sir!

435
00:40:32,449 --> 00:40:36,912
What should I do?

436
00:40:40,457 --> 00:40:41,959
AUM THANAWAT

437
00:40:45,254 --> 00:40:49,800
Officer! It’s me, Aum, the
player in Bangkok. I-I’m...

438
00:40:50,551 --> 00:40:53,887
I know, you’re barricaded in there, right?

439
00:40:55,180 --> 00:40:58,684
Yes, but the police
could break in any second.

440
00:40:58,934 --> 00:41:01,645
You’re the only person I can count on...

441
00:41:01,770 --> 00:41:04,690
Please tell me what should I do?

442
00:41:10,738 --> 00:41:14,241
- Let's move in! Everyone ready?
- Ready!

443
00:41:23,917 --> 00:41:25,002
Aum,

444
00:41:26,754 --> 00:41:28,464
you’ve got to surrender.

445
00:41:32,009 --> 00:41:36,889
No... If I give up now, Dao will be killed.

446
00:41:37,723 --> 00:41:43,520
At this rate, your
hostage... is going to die.

447
00:41:46,607 --> 00:41:48,430
You will have killed her.

448
00:41:49,818 --> 00:41:51,136
Killed that innocent girl.

449
00:42:09,338 --> 00:42:11,673
Dao’s innocent, too!

450
00:42:15,385 --> 00:42:17,596
Dao didn’t do anything wrong...

451
00:42:18,889 --> 00:42:20,224
That’s right.

452
00:42:21,892 --> 00:42:26,480
People who did nothing wrong
were taken hostage for this game.

453
00:42:35,614 --> 00:42:39,076
I want to save those innocent people.

454
00:42:42,996 --> 00:42:48,544
If I surrender, I’ll be
disqualified for failing,

455
00:42:48,669 --> 00:42:52,214
and not completing my
mission, and Dao will...

456
00:42:52,339 --> 00:42:55,968
But she will be saved.

457
00:43:01,431 --> 00:43:03,767
She’s the only one you can save!

458
00:43:09,606 --> 00:43:10,941
Please...

459
00:43:13,318 --> 00:43:14,862
Please save her...

460
00:43:42,222 --> 00:43:43,222
Officer...

461
00:43:46,560 --> 00:43:48,295
was there no other way?

462
00:44:53,961 --> 00:44:56,338
MAKE YOUR WISH COME TRUE

463
00:44:57,881 --> 00:45:01,969
Ever wanted something so much
that you'd try one of these?

464
00:45:05,931 --> 00:45:07,057
I might have.

465
00:45:07,349 --> 00:45:09,768
What was it? Can't you tell me?

466
00:45:10,185 --> 00:45:11,812
That'd be giving it away.

467
00:45:18,610 --> 00:45:20,570
Two of these, please.

468
00:45:34,864 --> 00:45:37,575
What did you wish for, Dao?

469
00:45:38,422 --> 00:45:39,422
Nothing.

470
00:45:40,007 --> 00:45:42,884
But if we both wear these,

471
00:45:44,088 --> 00:45:48,096
your wish will come true sooner,
don't you think?

472
00:46:27,546 --> 00:46:31,395
You're right. It came true right away.

473
00:46:32,768 --> 00:46:34,519
Pretty impressive, right?

474
00:46:37,689 --> 00:46:39,236
Are you sure about this?

475
00:46:40,233 --> 00:46:42,527
As long as you're happy.

476
00:46:43,945 --> 00:46:46,448
Only you truly love me.

477
00:46:59,669 --> 00:47:01,213
I'm sorry.

478
00:47:07,511 --> 00:47:10,347
Listen, everyone!

479
00:47:10,430 --> 00:47:13,266
Someone is about to be killed!

480
00:47:13,350 --> 00:47:16,269
Her name is Dao! Please save her!

481
00:48:13,994 --> 00:48:16,955
AUM THANAWAT HAS BEEN DISQUALIFIED.

482
00:48:44,733 --> 00:48:45,733
Breaking news.

483
00:48:46,067 --> 00:48:51,990
The woman who took
a student hostage at a Bangkok university

484
00:48:52,073 --> 00:48:54,784
has been taken into police custody.

485
00:48:54,868 --> 00:48:59,831
The hostage is confirmed to be unharmed.

486
00:49:03,493 --> 00:49:04,953
Officer...

487
00:49:05,712 --> 00:49:07,470
was there no other way?

488
00:49:21,213 --> 00:49:24,509
Put your anger aside. Show your kindness...

489
00:49:26,525 --> 00:49:30,779
Kindness that shields the weak.

490
00:49:34,199 --> 00:49:41,164
That's the right thing to do.

491
00:49:45,377 --> 00:49:46,920
Wait for me...

492
00:49:58,974 --> 00:50:01,935
I saw the news from Bangkok.
What’s your mission?

493
00:50:06,439 --> 00:50:07,941
To capture the mastermind.

494
00:50:10,902 --> 00:50:13,196
Mine is to commit murder.

495
00:50:21,579 --> 00:50:23,206
What do you plan to do?

496
00:50:56,114 --> 00:50:59,094
Complete my mission to save my daughter.

497
00:51:04,789 --> 00:51:06,541
Please don't be hasty.

498
00:51:06,850 --> 00:51:11,647
I will capture the mastermind.
Then I will rescue your daughter, too.

499
00:51:32,650 --> 00:51:34,319
Don’t interfere...

500
00:51:34,402 --> 00:51:38,365
I will complete my mission
and save Rian by any means possible.

501
00:51:41,743 --> 00:51:43,787
With this doctor's daughter...

502
00:51:43,995 --> 00:51:46,623
He talked to me in Korean at first.

503
00:51:47,916 --> 00:51:51,795
Korea... Seoul...

504
00:51:59,094 --> 00:52:03,765
I will solve this case and save everyone
mixed up in it. Including you.
